### Health check
GET http://localhost:5674/api/health

### Register user
POST http://localhost:5674/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Eco Member",
  "email": "member@example.com",
  "password": "StrongPass123",
  "address": "Sector 22, Chandigarh"
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:5674/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "member@example.com",
  "password": "StrongPass123"
}

### Create collection request (replace TOKEN)
POST http://localhost:5674/api/requests
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": "Plastic",
  "quantityKg": 2,
  "address": "Sector 22, Chandigarh",
  "scheduledDate": "2027-01-10",
  "notes": "Please call on arrival"
}
